So that's where you can see some of our research and our blogs about how we think about optimizing and building voice AI models for improving things.

482
00:53:41,829 --> 00:53:48,069
And you can also download and play around with the application which lets you speak instead of type anywhere on your computer.

483
00:53:48,069 --> 00:53:51,750
So that's, you know, the best set of resources.

484
00:53:51,750 --> 00:53:54,549
And then I have a small lightweight personal blog that you can find online as well.

